  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0.1:\n- Redesigned interface with combined table, frequency, and field selection.\n- Added required monitor names and editing of existing monitors.\n- Added pause, resume, remove, and multi-selection actions.\n- Added persistent monitor definitions restored per Dataverse environment.\n- Added versioned JSON export and import with metadata validation.\n- Added editable FetchXML validation and synchronization with the visual filter builder.\n- Added structured recent-change grid with ModifiedOn, ModifiedBy, record link, field, and old/new values.\n- Added environment and monitor names to Windows notification titles.\n- Added active and paused monitor counters.",
